1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,613
Vroom Vroom! Vehicles with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,913 --> 00:00:12,435
Mimo: Hi friends! Today we're learning about things that go! Cars, buses, trains, planes and more!

3
00:00:12,735 --> 00:00:14,642
Bruno: Things that go? Vroom vroom!

4
00:00:19,092 --> 00:00:23,865
Mimo: This is a car! A car has four wheels, and it goes vroom vroom!

5
00:00:24,165 --> 00:00:26,246
Mimo: And the horn goes beep beep!

6
00:00:26,546 --> 00:00:27,934
Mimo: Can you say car?

7
00:00:29,834 --> 00:00:31,555
Bruno: Beep beep! I'm a car!

8
00:00:33,955 --> 00:00:40,473
Mimo: This is a bus! A bus is big and long. It can carry lots and lots of people!

9
00:00:40,773 --> 00:00:42,234
Mimo: Can you say bus?

10
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,887
Pip: Wait for us! We want to ride the bus!

11
00:00:49,187 --> 00:00:51,582
Lulu: Ding ding! All aboard!

12
00:00:53,282 --> 00:00:58,046
Mimo: This is a train! A train goes on the tracks. Choo choo!

13
00:00:58,346 --> 00:00:59,810
Mimo: Can you say train?

14
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:03,977
Bruno: Let's make a train! Everybody hold on!

15
00:01:06,277 --> 00:01:08,788
Lulu: Choo choo! Chugga chugga choo choo!

16
00:01:10,488 --> 00:01:16,954
Mimo: Look up high! This is an airplane! An airplane flies in the sky, way above the clouds!

17
00:01:20,454 --> 00:01:22,044
Mimo: Can you say airplane?

18
00:01:25,944 --> 00:01:28,883
Pip: Wheee! I can fly too! I'm a little airplane!

19
00:01:30,583 --> 00:01:35,893
Mimo: This is a boat! A boat floats on the water. Splish, splash!

20
00:01:36,193 --> 00:01:37,705
Mimo: Can you say boat?

21
00:01:39,605 --> 00:01:42,348
Bruno: Boats are great! Except when I fall in the water.

22
00:01:42,648 --> 00:01:44,624
Bruno: Brrr! Splash!

23
00:01:48,324 --> 00:01:55,589
Mimo: Nee naw, nee naw! This is a fire truck! Fire trucks are big and red, and they help people!

24
00:01:55,889 --> 00:01:57,792
Mimo: Can you say fire truck?

25
00:01:59,692 --> 00:02:03,540
Lulu: Fire trucks have a long ladder and lots of water!

26
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:07,071
Bruno: Nee naw! Nee naw! Bruno the firefighter is here to help!

27
00:02:08,671 --> 00:02:11,807
Mimo: Let's say all the vehicles together! Ready?

28
00:02:12,107 --> 00:02:13,383
Bruno: Car! Beep beep!

29
00:02:14,183 --> 00:02:15,080
Pip: Bus!

30
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,395
Lulu: Train! Choo choo!

31
00:02:18,195 --> 00:02:19,138
Pip: Airplane!

32
00:02:19,938 --> 00:02:21,034
Lulu: Boat!

33
00:02:21,834 --> 00:02:23,509
Bruno: Fire truck! Nee naw!

34
00:02:25,109 --> 00:02:29,163
Mimo: Great job, friends! Which vehicle is your favorite?

35
00:02:29,463 --> 00:02:30,906
Bruno: An ice cream truck!

36
00:02:33,206 --> 00:02:36,661
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! See you next time!
